      "data": {
        "title": "Read tlz addresses in one place",
        "description": "Measured today: tlz is parsed separately in the browser shell, twice in the editor and once in the node creator, and not at all by the shared loader that Bridges, the class registry and bridged Methods use. A Bridge to a tlz address would not load. One function turns an address into what to fetch.",
